      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET DEBBIE (1) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (22.31) at this track in a Bottom Up - Maiden over 390m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Sure to be about the mark. PAW WALDORF (5) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on September 25 over 460m at Geelong behind Zipping Ablett beaten 1.5 lengths (26.69) in a Maiden. Overdue and is among the main hopes. WILL JENKINS (2) is on debut without trialling for this. Can measure up. PUBLIC HOUSE (7) hit the frame here last time and looks a chance again.",
